<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's PZ unit boosts Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's PZ unit boosts Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-quarter result for Nigerian conglomerate PZ Industries to end-August 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover			3,200   vs 2,600</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	465.9 vs   425.1</p>
<p>Taxation			  149.1 vs   157.3</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	 316.8 vs   267.8</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
